# Stat-Karmayogi AI

- FastAPI lives in `backend/app/`. Next.js App Router lives in `frontend/app/`.
- Put LangChain and Chroma in `backend/app/core/`. Put Bloom quiz generation in `backend/app/services/`.
- Keep routers thin. Use Pydantic models. Rule-based quiz generation must work without an LLM key.
- Endpoints: `POST /api/mcq/generate`, `POST /api/igot/recommend`, `POST /api/rag/ingest`.
- Prefer iGOT courses in recommendations. Cite source excerpts on MCQs. Do not scrape iGOT or claim live credits.
